#MOBILES
#100
#MOBFORMAT dynamic
Name constable man~
ShD a constable~
LnD A constable is here, patrolling the streets to keep peace.
~
Desc This constable wears a blue tabard over his shined breastplate.  He
appears to be in his early twenties or late teens.  Hanging from his belt is
a longsword, and in his hand he carries a hard wood club to subdue
troublemakers.  The constables of the town are mildly annoyed at their
duties being stripped from them by the Church and given to the knights of
Saint John.  
~
Race human~
