#101
The Central Temple of Recall~
Tall marble pillars support a vaulted dome at the heart of the sanctuary.
Travelers gather here in safety before venturing forth. The Altar of Sacrifice
lies to the north, the Donation Chamber to the east, the Initiate Entrance to
the west, and the Crafting Workshop to the south. Stairs lead up to the
Council Hall and down to the Training Barracks.
~
